{ a68j-options: -fstropping=supper }
{ As in ga68, a file to include is not found when its path has a ~ in it
  (docs/ga68-bug-reports.md, entry 27).  With -fgenie it is found, as in
  Algol 68 Genie (tests/formats/genie/read-tilde.a68). }
begin [[include "include/a~b/greeting.a68"]]
   puts (greeting + "'n")
end
